						<h1 class="page-title" >Local Clinics</h1>

					                    	<div class="copy ol-wrapper" >
		<p><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Amherst" title="Link to list of clinics in Amherst">Amherst</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Belchertown" title="Link to list of clinics in Belchertown">Belchertown</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Chicopee" title="Link to list of clinics in Chicopee">Chicopee</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Feeding Hills" title="Link to list of clinics in Feeding Hills">Feeding Hills<br /></a><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Greenfield" title="Link to list of clinics in Greenfield">Greenfield</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Holyoke" title="Link to list of clinics in Holyoke">Holyoke</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Longmeadow" title="Link to list of clinics in Longmeadow">Longmeadow</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Northampton" title="Link to list of clinics in Northampton">Northampton</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Palmer" title="Link to list of clinics in Palmer">Palmer</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Pittsfield" title="Link to list of clinics in Pittsfield">Pittsfield</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Springfield" title="Link to list of clinics in Springfield">Springfield</a><br /><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#West Springfield" title="Link to list of clinics in West Springfield">West Springfield<br /></a><a href="/student-life/caring-for-yourself/local-clinics#Westfield" title="Link to list of clinics in Westfield">Westfield</a></p>
