<p><strong>Minute Clinic</strong><br />165 University Dr.<br />Amherst, MA 01002<br /><a href="tel:866-389-2727">866.389.2727</a><br />Monday - Friday, 8 a.m. - 7 p.m.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br />Saturday, 9 a.m. - 5:30 p.m.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br />Sunday, 9 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.</p>
<h5><a name="Belchertown"></a>Belchertown</h5>
